special_abilities:
  - name: "Party Speech Making"
    description: "A special skill: 50% +4% per level of experience. Commissars learn speeches and well-known quotations by heart so as to have words for any occasion, and the best can improvise a stirring political address or produce just the right line from a speech, film or book. A successful roll strikes the right tone and moves listeners who already share the view. Many Commissars become known for their speeches and are asked to say a few words at tense, happy or solemn events, rather as a priest would be; the habit of quoting can make the character loved or loathed. Not a catalog skill: roll it from this figure."
