extraction_notes: "Rifts World Book 36: Sovietski printed 124-127 (cache p124-p127, cache page = printed folio + 0 for printed 38-177), a text layer; the manifest lists none of these pages as welded, corrupt or digit-substituted. Heading Commissar O.C.C., Civil Leaders and Managers (printed 124): a non-combat civil occupation, so occ_group optional and men_of_arms false. || XP: the Sovietski Commissar ladder in the Experience Tables (printed 224, cache p220). || SKILLS: Contacts is the catalog''s Contacts - Social Connections; Law (General) is Law; Law - Loopholes is Law: Loopholes; Identify Fruit and Plants is Identify Plants & Fruit. A Language or Literacy of choice is a Technical pick narrowed by prefix. Hand to Hand: Basic changes to Expert for two Secondary Skills, recorded as costs expert 2, the Sovietski Soldier''s reading of a Secondary Skill price. || SECTORS: Service Sector Training is one skill package in place of O.C.C. Related Skills, each with a Sector ability carrying its bonuses (the Sovietski Soldier''s M.O.S. shape). The percentages a Sector adds to O.C.C. skills are prose. In a pair printed X or Y (+N%), the bonus is read as both options''; Law - Loopholes (+10%) or Kremlinology gives the bonus to Law: Loopholes only. || PARTY SPEECH MAKING is a special skill with its own figure, an ability, not a catalog row. || MONEY: no savings at creation, so no starting_money; pay and the later nest egg are in restrictions. || EQUIPMENT: no rows for an identification card, calling cards, notebooks or a pocket calculator, and the light M.D.C. armor names no suit, so these are in restrictions."
